pty index. Plus 384-vs-768 dim mismatch when\n   tool + route paths touched the same collection.\n   **FIX:** added `get_knowledge_collection(client, name=\"knowledge\")` in `tools/knowledge.py` (always\n   attaches `LocalEmbeddingFunction()`); routed ALL call sites through it. `grep 'get_or_create_collection(\"knowledge\")'`\n   must return nothing.\n2. **No triples → empty graph.** Documents page's kg3d/synoptic_web reads Neo4j (`graph/kg3d/ontology.py`),\n   populated only by `deep_synthesis` (triple extraction). But Bridge `ingest()` posted `{workspace}` and\n   `deep_synthesis` defaults False → graph stayed empty though the chip promises triples.\n   **FIX:** `bridge.js ingest()` now sends `deep_synthesis:true`.\n3. **Silent failure.** Indexing/synthesis errors caught + reported as success.\n   **FIX:** ingest tracks per-file `indexed`/`error`, returns honest `status` ∈ completed /\n   completed_with_errors / failed + `indexed_files`/`failed_files`/`message`; added an **embedding-provider\n   preflight** (`get_embedding_sync(\"ping\")`; all-zeros → 503 \"start LM Studio/Lemonade/Ollama\").\n\n**Phase 2 started — surfaced RAG chat.** Backend has all surfaces (server.py registers Studio/Notebook/RAG/\nDeepProduce/AgentAmp/Pypes) but the Space-Agent shell only vendors a thin widget set + the Bridge cockpit\n(`app/L0/_all/mod/_prime_silo/bridge/bridge.js`; the rich Benny React frontend is NOT vendored — only in\n`archive/benny/frontend/`). Added an \"Ask the docs\" box to the Documents panel (bridge.js `askDocs()` → POST\n`/rag/chat` semantic; view.html `.ps-bridge__ask`; bridge.css). Still missing from shell: Notebook node-chat,\nStudio node editor, Pypes drilldown UI, AgentAmp, Rationale-Hub wiki.\n\n**Arch reminder:** shell proxies `/api/runtime/*` → Benny FastAPI `127.0.0.1:8005` (`server/lib/runtime_proxy.js`,\nstrips `/api/runtime`, injects `X-Benny-API-Key`). Bundled runtime started by `packaging/desktop/runtime_supervisor.js`.\n\n**STATUS: code done, py_com