{"parentUuid":"e5b71eae-ef34-444f-a117-0295a5f948c2","isSidechain":false,"message":{"model":"claude-opus-4-8","id":"msg_01Q4V7sr1vLPAJLyehyjUnWg","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"Phase 2 is built. The key realization shaped the approach:\n\n## Not React — the shell is deliberately React-free\n\nThe `dag.canvas` widget header literally documents that the team **already ported** Benny Studio's `WorkflowCanvas` to *\"Pure ES + DOM + SVG. No React, no ReactFlow, no build step.\"* So vendoring React/ReactFlow would fight the architecture. Phase 2 is the **interactive half** built the same way — a vanilla SVG node editor.\n\n## What you now have: a real visual node editor\n\nNew widget [`workflow_designer/index.js`](prime-silo/app/L0/_all/mod/_prime_silo/widgets/workflow_designer/index.js), wired into the Flows panel's workflow detail:\n\n- **Palette** — toolbar with the six Benny Studio node kinds (Trigger, LLM/Agent, Tool, Logic, Data, A2A); click to add a node.\n- **Drag** nodes to reposition (positions persist on save).\n- **Connect** — drag from a node's right-edge dot onto another node to draw an edge.\n- **Select + edit** — click a node → a config form appears (label + kind) that updates the canvas live.\n- **Delete** — Delete key or the \"Delete selected\" button (removes the node and its edges).\n- **Save** reads the live canvas graph and persists it via the Phase 1 endpoint (already verified). Editable **name/description** fields too.\n\n**Flow:** open any workflow → **Design** (templates open read-only to view; **Clone** makes an editable copy that drops straight into the designer). **New** starts a blank canvas. The **Edit JSON** view is kept as a power-user fallback, kept in sync with the canvas.\n\nThe node/edge output matches the backend's `NodeDefinition`/`EdgeDefinition` exactly, so saving validates cleanly.\n\n## Status & verification\n- `node --check` passes on the widget and bridge; synced into both exes' `resources/app` (plus the new widget dir).\n- **Not auto-verifiable here** — it's an interactive Alpine+SVG canvas that needs the full shell + runtime, so it requires a **relaunch of the exe** to exercise. The save path itself (the only backend touchpoint) was already proven live in Phase 1.\n- Nothing committed/released yet.\n\nThis session has accumulated a lot of unshipped work (adaptive RAG fixes + lean pipeline, per-file ingest, thinking toggle, workflow library + designer). When you've relaunched and confirmed the designer feels right, I'd suggest we **commit + cut a release** so it's all baked into a real build — and separately circle back to nail down the adaptive-RAG speed (the one thread still genuinely unresolved). Want me to do a verification pass by launching the app, or leave it to you?"}],"stop_reason":"end_turn","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":1074,"cache_read_input_tokens":430097,"output_tokens":938,"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":1074,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"not_available","iterations":[{"input_tokens":2,"output_tokens":938,"cache_read_input_tokens":430097,"cache_creation_input_tokens":1074,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":1074},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard"},"diagnostics":null},"requestId":"req_011CcGGDKwdArF44CJSxJ9n8","type":"assistant","uuid":"2e6de3df-c356-4764-bc6b-6aefaf92ad1d","timestamp":"2026-06-21T10:40:42.243Z","userType":"external","entrypoint":"claude-desktop","cwd":"C:\\Users\\nsdha\\OneDrive\\binary16\\prime-silo","sessionId":"50d606f7-67d3-4645-8504-2cafd7318b4d","version":"2.1.181","gitBranch":"HEAD","slug":"recursive-growing-sun"}
